  "details": "I am using the VRchat (a-test)version,.\n\nIt is a branch specifically set up to solve the screen jitter of AMD graphics cards in VR,the test code is Ag1V3wZ6b1fJ\n\nSince three days ago, YouTube videos have been unable to play properly. Switch to the official and beta versions to play normally. However, these two versions do not support AMD graphics cards well, and some maps under VR may experience screen shake. It is speculated that the issue is caused by the outdated version of YouTubedl in a-test. Please request to fix the support for VRchat (a-test) version of YouTube",
